WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,050
You go in alone

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:02,770
Who will support you in an emergency?

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:03,970
Support shit

4
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:05,770
You are only causing trouble for me if you go in.

5
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,000
Say it again

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,800
I'm here to have a heart-to-heart talk with a client

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,320
What matters is a gentle attitude

8
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,240
Good service

9
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,560
You point guns at people

10
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,960
How can I develop my business?

11
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,920
In case the customer is not satisfied, leave a negative review

12
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,480
You won’t give me the outside guard’s commission?

13
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,780
let him go

14
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,250
But there is a condition

15
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,010
Put on your tactical communications headset

16
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:26,270
Keep the call open throughout the whole process to complete the transaction

17
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:39,900
First floor security

18
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:43,770
There is nothing on the second floor except a dead mouse

19
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,170
everything is fine
